  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia-Solomon Islands Resource Facility Program for financial years 2020-21 to 2022-23</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Australia-Solomon Islands Resource Facility Program provided logistical and operational support to DFAT to deliver sector programs (for example in education, health, gender equality, civil society, governance, justice and other small grants). This investment has two outcomes: 1) Demonstrably add value to Solomon Islands Government and DFAT development agendas and policy dialogue and 2) deliver flexible, responsive and high-quality strategic advice and operational aid management support to DFAT.  Cross-program learning and value for money assessments enhance facility coherence and inform innovations.</narrative>
  </description>
